    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d293">

                <pb facs="0333" n="329" xml:id="pg329"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.0146/759: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Consul General at Hankow</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Spiker</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                        State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hankow</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1939-12-15T10:00:00+08:00">December 15,
                            1939—10 a.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received December 16—5 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>278. Referring to my No. 276, December 13, 2 p.m.,<anchor n="20" xml:id="d293-f1"
                    /> and previous concerning withdrawal of British and French gunboats from the
                    Yangtze. British have ordered withdrawal of three further gunboats from
                    Shanghai-Hankow section of the river, these including Hankow station ship H. M.
                    S. <hi rendition="#italic">Peterel</hi> which departs December 18 leaving U. S.
                    S. <hi rendition="#italic">Guam</hi> as only non-Japanese gunboat here.</p>
                <p>Repeated to Peiping, Chungking, Shanghai.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Spiker</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d293-f1" n="20" xml:id="d293-f1-content">
                <p>This telegram reported the departure of a French gunboat (893.0146/758).</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
